    "Uninstalling TurnOver. First VoiceOver's settings: VoiceOver Utility opens and closes by itself, about ten seconds." : {
      "comment" : "Spoken message",
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Удаляю TurnOver. Сначала настройки VoiceOver: программа VoiceOver Utility сама откроется и закроется, около десяти секунд."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
