      }
    },
    "Up and Down move through the messages. Return opens one; Tab goes to the message and the mailboxes. Delete deletes." : {
      "comment" : "A hint, said after a pause on an item",
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
